  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖中央冷却系统海水侧自动反冲洗功能、热带海域适应性及减少人工清洗频次的要求。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="3">
    <Requirement id="ER-P056-01" level="1" requirementType="function">
      <sysml:Name>海水侧自动反冲洗功能</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>中央冷却系统海水侧应配置自动反冲洗过滤器，该过滤器应能按压差信号自动启动反冲洗程序，无需人工干预。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P056" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-FILT-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-FILT-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无法自动反冲洗将导致海水侧生物附着加剧，增加人工清洗频次，影响冷却效率。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查设计图纸确认配置了自动反冲洗过滤器。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟压差信号，确认反冲洗程序自动启动。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【海水侧自动反冲洗功能】，来自原始需求「海水侧自动反冲洗功能」。E-SUPP-FILT-002（CCS规则）支撑了热带航区宜配自动反冲洗过滤器；E-SUPP-FILT-001（DNV规则）支撑了自动反冲洗型过滤器应能按压差信号自动启动。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
