    <Requirement id="ER-P056-03" level="1" requirementType="maintainability">
      <sysml:Name>减少人工清洗频次</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>中央冷却系统应通过配置自动反冲洗过滤器及合理的系统设计，减少海水侧人工清洗频次，具体清洗周期按厂家技术文件和项目维护程序确认。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P056" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SW-CLEAN-005" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-COOLER-CLEAN-016" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>人工清洗频次过高将增加维护成本和工作量。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查厂家技术文件确认自动反冲洗过滤器的清洗周期。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间验证反冲洗功能有效，人工清洗频次应低于无自动反冲洗方案。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【减少人工清洗频次】，来自原始需求「减少人工清洗频次」。E-SW-CLEAN-005和E-COOLER-CLEAN-016（间接证据）支撑了清洗维护要求，但未给出具体频次，需结合厂家文件。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
